xt":"The repair changes eight XUL treecol values to primary=\"true\" and narrows three platform subject-padding selectors from [primary] to [primary=\"true\"]. Accepted surviving XUL columns and platform CSS retain that exact value; two dialogs later use different HTML tree markup. The source supports a local markup/selector contract, not a general Boolean-attribute rule or paired engine guarantee. No test is added and no UI, keyboard, screen-reader or contrast rendering run occurred.","title":"XUL tree primary columns and subject padding use the exact true value","version":1,"visibility":"shared"}
